## Category Annotations

For public API organization:

```dart
/// {@category Views}
/// {@subCategory Splash}

/// {@category Helpers}
/// {@subCategory Storage}

/// {@category Widgets}
/// {@subCategory Layout}
```

## Debug Logging Style

```dart
debugPrint('🚀 Initializing view...');
debugPrint('✅ Data loaded successfully');
debugPrint('❌ Error: $error');
debugPrint('⚠️ Warning: slow network');
debugPrint('🔍 Debug: state = $state');
debugPrint('📊 Info: ${items.length} items');
```

## Checklist

- [ ] Emoji in first line for classes
- [ ] Brief description, then details
- [ ] Features list with emojis (3-5 items)
- [ ] @category and @subCategory for public APIs
- [ ] All public parameters documented
- [ ] Methods: purpose, returns, throws
